<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.44 bln -March 19.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.44 bln -March 19.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves firmed to $3.444 billion as of March 19, from $3.431 billion on March 12.</p>
<p> FOREX RESERVES	 March 19   March 12   Feb 26   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)   3.444     3.431	3.514     3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	1.891     1.837	1.830     2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector 5.335     5.268	5.344     5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
